@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #0b7a75
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #6b7280
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #0b7a75
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #fdfdfd
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #f3f4f6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9ca3af

title flow_static_witness — request-type triage\nA static page we own fires onload; the UniversalNavigator witnesses and logs it, and decides nothing.

actor "Person/Client\n(static page we own)" as Client
participant "Gate\n(facade)" as Gate
participant "UniversalNavigator\n(SharedServices)" as UN

Client -> Gate : onload event fires in our frame\n(page name, no session token)
activate Gate

note over Gate : Dumb transport only.\nCollect session token (none),\nHTTP head, POST/GET params.\nVerify nothing; own no route.

Gate -> UN : forward(page name, head, params)
deactivate Gate
activate UN

note over UN : TRIAGE by declared proof (live tool registry)\nroute_name = the page's own route\n(e.g. privacy, terms, architecture, products)\ncall_type = static_witness\nproof.method = none  -> nothing to verify\nOnly node that accepts external traffic.

UN -> UN : log "frame popped"\n(page name, timings)

alt static error reported on the page (route bootstrapError)
  UN -> UN : log static error\n(severity matching impact)
end

note over UN : No session. No UtteranceManager.\nNo page determined, no render ledger,\nno reconciliation, no merge.\nA pure witness/log path — DECIDES NOTHING.

UN --> Gate : 204 acknowledged (witnessed)
activate Gate
Gate --> Client : stream ack back
deactivate Gate
deactivate UN

@enduml
